{"name": "Project Tomorrow", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402200/extras/ac4e9e1f34a7291270ce042818f82af1.poster.avif?t=1787282960\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402200/extras/ac4e9e1f34a7291270ce042818f82af1.webm?t=1787282960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402200/extras/ac4e9e1f34a7291270ce042818f82af1.mp4?t=1787282960\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BASE BUILDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402200/extras/28f821974f7b2254466904e20cb2ad7d.poster.avif?t=1787282960\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402200/extras/28f821974f7b2254466904e20cb2ad7d.webm?t=1787282960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402200/extras/28f821974f7b2254466904e20cb2ad7d.mp4?t=1787282960\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform a barren planet into a lush world habitable for humans. Gather resources, build and expand your base, deploy terraforming machines\u2014and defend them from an ever-present alien threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEFEND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402200/extras/838cbf4522e47b701e3d78eb831fbb21.poster.avif?t=1787282960\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402200/extras/838cbf4522e47b701e3d78eb831fbb21.webm?t=1787282960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402200/extras/838cbf4522e47b701e3d78eb831fbb21.mp4?t=1787282960\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terraforming attracts attention. As alien forces grow hostile, they send waves of attackers to dismantle your base and machines. Construct defensive structures, upgrade your arsenal, and repel each assault.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402200/extras/684b5b7913ef345960737e2bc793eb3f.poster.avif?t=1787282960\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402200/extras/684b5b7913ef345960737e2bc793eb3f.webm?t=1787282960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402200/extras/684b5b7913ef345960737e2bc793eb3f.mp4?t=1787282960\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resources are limited, and survival is never guaranteed. Explore the planet to gather materials and locate hidden caches of food, water, and seeds. Grow crops, construct water purification systems, and keep your colony alive.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A base-building survival game with terraforming and crafting. Earth lies poisoned and abandoned ten thousand years after invasion. Awaken from stasis, defend your fragile foothold, and restore a dead world so humanity can live here again.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_